      <Desc>PROGRAMS CONDUCTED THROUGHOUT THE YEAR INCLUDING SEMINARS, NETWORKING OPPORTUNITIES, CONTRACT SOURCING EXCHANGES, AND WORKSHOPS WITH THE PURPOSE OF STRENGTHENING THE CAPABILITIES OF DIVERSE BUSINESS ENTERPRISES WHILE INCREASING ECONOMIC OPPORTUNITIES FOR THEM.WE ALSO HAVE A COLLABORATION WITH THE UNIVERSITY OF SAN DIEGO SCHOOL OF BUSINESS FACULTY TO PROVIDE CAPACITY BUILDING TRAINING TO DIVERSE BUSINESS ENTERPRISES.WE HAVE ESTABLISHED LOCAL COLLABORATIONS WITH ACCESS COMMUNITY SERVICES, SAN DIEGO YOUTH SERVICES, REGIONAL TASKFORCE FOR HOMELESS AND MANY OTHER COMMUNITY BASED ORGANIZATIONS THAT SUPPORT UNDERSERVED COMMUNITIES.</Desc>
